  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During Fang Yuan’s change form Immortal Gu refinement under the ancient battle formation Heavenly Giant Solor, Lang Ya land spirit names Silent World as a move that counters sound path and activates it while the silver giant shines. Thunder vanishes even though dark clouds and lightning remain; after a long time the thunder returns, rising from soft to loud. Lang Ya land spirit then says that with the tribulation’s then size, even a tenfold expansion would not interrupt the refinement.",
